        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeremiya goorgweach aba jeeda gheeda sibata ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'asheanda hidu heeda Yeremiya leabu heeda NG'UTAMIIDA:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Miinaada aba gidaghuuta gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak girukuti aba hoowa ng'asheanji, nea giyeeshi, Oaleaydiit ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA, fuga sean bea Yuda oowadiinayi jeedeaba gheanyi aghadoawana NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA bea lugweega, was ASEETA Israeli, asina naweadingeagwa ea sinaweegeagwa, ak gaydanung' oopiidana jeedeaba gheawi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu ghoamwaschi ng'asheesu bea ng'uyeegean bea gideaba: ‘Nih gheeda sibata ASEETA, nih gheeda sibata ASEETA, aba huumwa nih gheeda sibata ASEETA.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aba huumwa inyas gajayamwa naweadingeagwa ea sinaweegeagwa, nea goosiniisi geat doobiiwnata, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "inyas ea majajiira rabasta, ghana bananeeda, ghana masinung'weanda, nea moahiidani foojeanda siida maba riing'a aba hiji, nea inyas gajanung'waada badita aseecheeka jea gwasawaneegwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak abeeda gaydanung' oopiidana hiji, jeeda nyeanyiida ghayi aadawji ghweanigeagwa aba garayi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ng'ula, agooga goosisi masaweega ng'asheega ng'uyeega marachi gil, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghamneawa gajajagwadiischeena, gajareang'ni, gajahiseada, gajayaaga habeawooda ng'uyeega, gajagwardeaysiina Baali geediga ng'andidi, ak ghoabwachi aseecheeka miyoanala, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ama ng'ata ghoapkaanyi amiinaada aba madeedeanyu hiji bea gheawiin, sinal aba gheawungeasu, ak gooyeenyi, ‘Aseasa silealneasa!’ nea googutkuti sinoodeaba ng'asheesu munyasiin? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heapi gheawi sinal aba gheawungeasuun niiwa gheeda mareanghooga aba heedeang'wa? Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, Ng'ula neadeaksi geaw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aweayeena hoowa bea gheenyuun mida Shilo, heeda ghayi anung' goobiida gheawungeasu aba mwadi, ak ghoadayi gideasimi aba munyinda fugeasu was Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, aba gideaba noosinyi ng'asheesu seaniini, ak eara dadap giibaloodeang'wa, ea mooleeysiinean iit, eara iyeaguurneegwa ea manyeara ghuusigeagwa ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean aba gideasimi mujiineeda Shilo, ghoah gichea dasima gheawi siguuruuna gheawungeasuun, oosiniisi masaweega, ea heeda ghayi agoonyeegwa ea ghweanigeagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydaang'aamwaneegwa madeedeanyu, gawuurji gida aahoandi fuga oorooroocheewi, was jeacheenga Efraimu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Heeheeweega buuneeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Asi ang'iing'i, adiidu gimusiischeesi fiisu, adiidu gimiindi shooka ghana musischeena aba ramaseanda nyaawa, nea adiidu giimearmearanay aba gideaba maydealeeysiineey iita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ang'iing'i ming'uli gidasin aba jeeda mujiinajeega Yuda ea jeeda naweadinga mujiineeda Yerusalemu?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Diibiga ghoamughuush ghweenga, nea ghaghwar ghweaniga beasta, nea gadeemga ghwadas dearanga jea gwasina mukaateeda gatmooda was sugoocheanda bea humng'eeda, ak goodalealsa aseecheeka suuk haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi was difaayi, ghang'udanaan nyarasta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, ghamneawa iing'ulayi ghoanyareasan? Ghwanyareas geat saawa, ea ghang'uda geat deembeaneega? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA: ng'ula gaydahisa nyarasteanyu hiji, badayda buuneeda ea diyeanga, badayda geediga dareabeeta ea haghweega ng'eanyiida; hean gayghwayeat nea majeamu eenuus.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA bea lugweega, was ASEETA fuga Israeli: “Ooheasiina lukghumajeegeagwa badahuuka haleanjeedeang'wa sisabwa geadi, ama ng'ata ghoayaaji banyeega nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba eaweeda ghayi earuuni saawa ng'eanyiida Misri, miideabalool ghweanigeagwa ghana daadaw diigheanda aba badayda haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi ea lukghumajeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea diigheanda aadawji saawa ea nih, ‘Ooleeysiina iita ng'asheegeasu, ak abeeda gaydoaw ASEETEANG'WA, ak gajahuuwa agooga fugeasu; ak goobadiini jeeda naweadinga sean ghayi agoonyeegwa, ak abeeda gajanyasa giibinda.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak saawa ea masinneani mureeda nea mooleeysiinean iidiga nyaawa, ng'ata ghwaat naweadinga nyaawa ea girgweaguutka nyaawa, ea hang'oonyaka gurooruunatka nyaawa gwaneadi, ak hean gabiikta bwadaw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gidang'eada eaweeda ghayi rinna ghweanigeagwa ng'eanyiida Misri ea ghoah ghamneawa, mii danung'waada giijeaknooda weajoodigeasu was sibanga eawoojiga sean; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak eara gwasa, saawa ea mooleeysiinean iidiga nyaawa nea maduupa gil, hean goohang'oonyi gheatkweaka nyaawa. Ak gwasin dea muy ea ghwanaawa ghweaniga nyaawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.26",
