          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ak gayrukusiina ng'asheesu seaniini, ak ea maygooleeysiineey iidiga nyaawa. Gayguuriisiina, ak ea mayghwasha ghuutaang'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajeeshina saawa, ‘Nih eemeeda mooleeysiina iit NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA nyaawa, nea gwanya mureeda, nea ea ning'amwa jeenyaawa huumeanda; sigeandeawa ghuusiga nyaawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sinaweega munyas aba jeeda moangoachiyda Hinomu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, “Fuga Yuda nisin riing'eeda aba madeedeanyu; niyiin sanaamajeega jeeda gheeda siguuriideawa gheawungeasu, ghang'uda ririnnyeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea nideas heeda wagiida bea Dofeti, mida jeeda moangoachiyda orjeeda Hinomu, was heeda jea gagwardeaysa orjooga nyaawa ea haweega nyaawa; Nea aniini ea mii daadaw siniteaba ng'asheanji, nea ea miighoan jeedeanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, asi ng'ula gayghwahidu eawoojiga jea ea mudu gwayeena Dofeti, ghana moangoachiyda orjeeda Hinomu, gaygwayeena moangoachiyda miyeeda: aba gideaba gajeebung'sa buuneeda Dofeti, aba gideaba manda hich nuut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea muscheekeaba fiisu gayghoah daghwarda dariidaka humng'eeda, ea diyeanga jarooda; nea ea maygwanda siichea ghahoan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydanung' goosha ghuusiga rearga ea hooseaneega aba jeeda mujiinajeega Yuda ea jeeda naweadinga Yerusalemu, ea hooseaneega sibeeda ea siida geeshi, aba gideaba ng'eanyiida gaydanung' ghoah raghoonyeanda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
